id: pm-rlm-pdtc
title: Answer evidence coverage for declared question components
description: "Require recursive answers to carry bounded source witnesses for every declared question component, with explicit unsupported and unknown outcomes. Acceptance: replay verifies every witness digest; omitted evidence cannot support an answer; validation performs no hidden model call. Add typed SDK and CLI surfaces, compact TOON/JSON, typed refusals with remedies, documentation and public-tracker no-git validation."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-21T21:11:52.137Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-21T21:23:12.641Z"
assignee: codex-agent
claim_principal: codex-agent
author: codex-agent
parent: pm-rlm-a1ih
comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-21T21:12:22.094Z",codex-agent,"Overlap checked against the pinned CLI SDK query/aggregate contract, pm-context context-pack/context-handoff and receipt APIs, and pm-rlm aggregate/replay code. Core owns arithmetic, pm-context assembles context bundles and usage receipts, and existing RLM replay certifies execution. None requires evidence coverage per declared question component. Plan: opt-in immutable component declarations, bounded source-witness observations, component-only final answers with supported/unsupported/unknown statuses, deterministic replay and read-only coverage CLI. Builds on PR #13; merge after it. Run targeted local tests/typecheck/lint and use unchanged CI npm/Bun release gates for full evidence."
  "2026-10-21T21:19:34.179Z",codex-agent,"Implemented opt-in component contracts and bounded source-witness/answer actions, typed evidence refusals with remedies, deterministic read-only evidence inspection, and a separate read-only source tracker SDK option. First 8 focused regressions passed. Public acceptance used verified public pm-lint revision f2c20efa78139f4071f3dd08d317bea05337fe28: 12 real items, 54941 JSON bytes, 30 read-only source files unchanged; 5 components (3 supported, 1 unsupported, 1 unknown), 3 witnesses of 64/42/89 bytes, 1172-byte JSON report, 4 protocol-fixture steps, zero external inference calls and zero validation model calls. Digest tampering and omitted observation both refused. No provider quality claim."
  "2026-10-21T21:23:12.641Z",codex-agent,"Local focused validation: pm test --run --progress executed node --test --test-concurrency=1 test/evidence.test.ts test/core.test.ts test/commands.test.ts with 20/20 passing. Real HTTP command acceptance counted exactly 2 visible provider-fixture requests through run, evidence, replay and completed resume. Behavioral revert proof: node test/evidence-revert.ts passed 3/3; disabling witness admission, trusting persisted witnesses without rehashing, or dropping component completeness each caused the targeted regression to fail by assertion. Authored bytes restored exactly. Typecheck, lint, build, docstring and zero-duplication checks passed; full npm/Bun release checks remain delegated to CI because the shared CPU is saturated."
